{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_x_025suz_2_1_2_025_22_t01",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:5b898ddf943b849f6279cbec93014c2ff56f6393433d5888d36fb2ed1b079d6f",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_x_025suz_2_1_2_025_22_t01:1_2_025_22_t01:cmd-000007:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:855fff39ce5c16fa555fddc64442870fb0c6fdd840c3d8f00a3467f95fe38df2",
      "text": "哟，制作人。\n今天度过了最棒的生日啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_025suz_2_1_2_025_22_t01:1_2_025_22_t01:cmd-000009:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:502d4745b04e0292236bcc45b5cc8e83767e6089af0266e95fbfc9d7f0426d87",
      "text": "玄武居然会给我做松饼，\n感动死我了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_025suz_2_1_2_025_22_t01:1_2_025_22_t01:cmd-000011:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ee92d25fc800025e19ffd428685e68a33f6c289e02013feeec610073cdb4fc83",
      "text": "最近那家伙身上总有股甜甜的香味，\n原来是一直在反复练习啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_025suz_2_1_2_025_22_t01:1_2_025_22_t01:cmd-000013:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1006243c9f14ac87fdba22804a1d3cd9b468a536ebe5597949390897f7ca3ed1",
      "text": "连点心都能做出来……！\n咕～果然玄武那家伙太厉害了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_025suz_2_1_2_025_22_t01:1_2_025_22_t01:cmd-000015:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:293290d16af7becaccf6bdd986b773836ae4046d9ab3848750c38439909e7f33",
      "text": "让人很向往呢",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_025suz_2_1_2_025_22_t01:1_2_025_22_t01:cmd-000016:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:77283f3039a49b6556f47cbd04e75f2cbc1fccad3e116df8365e714a5a924ba3",
      "text": "你们建立了\n很好的信赖关系呢",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_025suz_2_1_2_025_22_t01:1_2_025_22_t01:cmd-000019:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e640cd46e11e91477049ab5580a0a600344f8be9300b699ba8b0e145c2b44ef3",
      "text": "噢！玄武简直就是纯爷们中的纯爷们啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_025suz_2_1_2_025_22_t01:1_2_025_22_t01:cmd-000024:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3927d03ed63a951bfe62ead5f96b78b45e603eada71b7e48552a64aa2a5a69fc",
      "text": "嘿嘿，虽然有点害羞但真高兴啊。\n今后我也要作为不辱伙伴之名的男子汉全力狂奔！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_025suz_2_1_2_025_22_t01:1_2_025_22_t01:cmd-000028:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:405ecfde245bc4607428e0076d5faaa81a3484fa67a2e26c210131393bc4108e",
      "text": "说起来，玄武说那个松饼的食谱是找英雄先生教的对吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_025suz_2_1_2_025_22_t01:1_2_025_22_t01:cmd-000030:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a8f490de7564261778cd7747b13c0f0a69470acf65c1957a8f1fef1769dd62e0",
      "text": "我也想用那个食谱，\n给玄武做一顿好吃的松饼啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_025suz_2_1_2_025_22_t01:1_2_025_22_t01:cmd-000032:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2d33d6f343abec65ef4a7020c1088d159b3fa66a45a7981b035ec0bb20d38d8b",
      "text": "……等等，做一模一样的岂不是算不上谢礼了？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_025suz_2_1_2_025_22_t01:1_2_025_22_t01:cmd-000034:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1ff25a7efa55f6d755dba42aa67b8725a920ec8939cdca573d91ff2c5918c8a3",
      "text": "制作人啊！怎么给玄武回礼，\n我也能找你商量商量吗！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_025suz_2_1_2_025_22_t01:1_2_025_22_t01:cmd-000036:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a51502a0b6b000aa5402038bbf6f9177daabc70c4001ef7f3310fd599062b692",
      "text": "不管是玄武生日那天，还是平时的日子，\n我都想把这股熊熊燃烧的感谢之情最大限度传达给他啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_025suz_2_1_2_025_22_t01:1_2_025_22_t01:cmd-000038:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b9651974dd46b4b0b61191e0de4bfcb9428141bf41b768751e920af2780cd7e7",
      "text": "当然可以",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_025suz_2_1_2_025_22_t01:1_2_025_22_t01:cmd-000041:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:06c0318a557ff498371618c95777a93cb17da69f905cd257c8b4c7ce2fe9d775",
      "text": "好嘞，说定了啊！说到感谢，\n我也得向制作人道谢才行。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_025suz_2_1_2_025_22_t01:1_2_025_22_t01:cmd-000043:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3a289f5256177a52964d6a3f5fbbe9d988587f88586daf35c4a5e74da4096e39",
      "text": "可不光是今天的事，\n平时也受了你超级多的照顾啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_025suz_2_1_2_025_22_t01:1_2_025_22_t01:cmd-000045:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:48b1ff4d5fb73d8d4f6402f039dbaf64d95edb0c6f217d0a2fe3c389af844496",
      "text": "一直以来多谢你啦，制作人！\n今后也请多多关照啊，Burning！！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
